        151.56,
        552.16,
        176.82,
        103.53,
        176.82
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that with effect from the 9th January,\n2004 :-"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        147.56,
        190.29,
        553.35,
        190.29,
        553.35,
        227.34,
        147.56,
        227.34
      ],
      "text": "i) The Prime Minister relinquished the charge of the offices of Minister of\nEnvironment and Forests and Minister of Non-Conventional Energy\nSources;"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        148.16,
        239.97,
        553.35,
        239.97,
        553.35,
        276.18,
        148.16,
        276.18
      ],
      "text": "ii) Shri Kariya Munda relinquished the charge of the office of Minister of\nCoal and assumed the charge of the office of Minister of Non-\nconventional Energy Sources;"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        148.16,
        289.65,
        553.35,
        289.65,
        553.35,
        313.22,
        148.16,
        313.22
      ],
      "text": "iii) Kum. Mamata Banerjee assumed the charge of the office of Minister of\nCoal and Mines;"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        148.16,
        326.7,
        553.35,
        326.7,
        553.35,
        375.53,
        148.16,
        375.53
      ],
      "text": "iv) Shri Ramesh Bais relinquished the charge of the office of Minister of\nState (Independent charge) in the Ministry of Mines and assumed the\ncharge of the office of Minister of State (Independent charge) in the\nMinistry of Environment and Forests; and"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        147.56,
        389.0,
        553.35,
        389.0,
        553.35,
        437.84,
        147.56,
        437.84
      ],
      "text": "v) Dr. Vallabhbhai Ramjibhai Kathiria relinquished the charge of the office\nof Minister of State in the Ministry of Human Resource Development\nand assumed the charge of the office of Minister of State in the\nMinistry of Health and Family Welfare."
    },
